  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ツノの　あなに　ドラメシヤを　いれて\nくらす。　たたかいになると　マッハの\nスピードで　ドラメシヤを　とばす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "뿔에 있는 구멍에 드라꼰을 넣고\n지낸다. 싸움이 시작되면 마하의\n스피드로 드라꼰을 날린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "讓多龍梅西亞住在自己角上的\n洞裡。戰鬥開始後會用音速\n將多龍梅西亞發射出去。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il vit en compagnie de Fantyrm qui logent\ndans les trous de ses cornes. Quand il passe\nà l’attaque, il les propulse à la vitesse du son.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es transportiert Grolldra in den Löchern an\nseinen Hörnern. Kommt es zum Kampf, schießt\nes diese mit Mach-Geschwindigkeit ab.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en compañía de Dreepy, a los que hospeda\nen el interior de sus cuernos. Los dispara a\nvelocidad supersónica en combate.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive assieme ai Dreepy, che ospita all’interno\ndei buchi sulle sue corna. Quando lotta\nli espelle alla velocità del suono.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When it isn’t battling, it keeps Dreepy in the\nholes on its horns. Once a fight starts, it launches\nthe Dreepy like supersonic missiles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ツノの　穴に　ドラメシヤを　入れて\n暮らす。　戦いになると　マッハの\nスピードで　ドラメシヤを　飛ばす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "让多龙梅西亚住在自己角上的\n洞里。战斗开始后会用音速\n将多龙梅西亚发射出去。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en compañía de Dreepy, a los que hospeda\nen el interior de sus cuernos. Los dispara a\nvelocidad supersónica en combate.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ツノに　はいった　ドラメシヤは\nマッハの　スピードで　とばされるのを\nこころまちに　しているらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "뿔에 들어간 드라꼰은\n마하의 속도로 날려지기를\n기대하고 있는 것 같다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "牠角裡的多龍梅西亞\n似乎滿心期待著能被\n以音速發射出去。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il paraît que les Fantyrm installés dans ses cornes\nattendent impatiemment le moment où ils seront\npropulsés à la vitesse du son.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die Grolldra, die in seinen Hörnern sitzen,\nwarten angeblich voller Spannung darauf, mit\nMach-Geschwindigkeit abgefeuert zu werden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al parecer, los Dreepy que residen en sus\ncuernos esperan con ilusión el momento de ser\npropulsados a velocidad supersónica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "I Dreepy che vivono nelle sue corna attendono\nansiosamente di essere sparati alla velocità\ndel suono.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Apparently the Dreepy inside Dragapult’s\nhorns eagerly look forward to being launched out\nat Mach speeds.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ツノに　入った　ドラメシヤは\nマッハの　スピードで　飛ばされるのを\n心待ちに　しているらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "它角里的多龙梅西亚\n似乎满心期待着能被\n以音速发射出去。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al parecer, los Dreepy que residen en sus\ncuernos esperan con ilusión el momento de ser\npropulsados a velocidad supersónica.",
